{"title":"Career Roadmap · Wellness Consultant","role":"Wellness Consultant","summary":"A Wellness Consultant helps individuals improve overall health and lifestyle through evidence-based guidance on nutrition, physical activity, sleep, stress management, healthy habits and preventive wellness.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Nutrition & Dietetics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Nutrition & Dietetics graduate, this is a strongly aligned career path, particularly in wellness centres, health and fitness companies, corporate wellness programs, hospitals, preventive-health organisations, health-tech companies and private consulting."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"“Wellness Consultant” is a broad industry title rather than a uniformly regulated professional designation. The scope of practice varies by employer and jurisdiction. A graduate should distinguish general wellness/nutrition education from clinical dietetics or medical nutrition therapy, which may require additional qualifications, registration or supervised training depending on the role and location."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Likely Career Stage","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Student / Wellness Intern / Nutrition Executive"},{"text":"Nutrition fundamentals, counselling, lifestyle education"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Wellness Consultant / Nutrition & Wellness Coach"},{"text":"Individual programs, corporate wellness, client management"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Wellness Consultant / Program Manager"},{"text":"Specialisation, program design, team management"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Wellness Program Lead / Health & Wellness Strategist / Independent Consultant"},{"text":"Digital health, preventive wellness, behaviour change and large-scale programs"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Wellness Consultant Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A wellness consultant typically works with individuals or organisations to improve sustainable health behaviours."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Assess lifestyle and wellness goals."},{"text":"Understand dietary and lifestyle patterns."},{"text":"Educate clients about balanced nutrition."},{"text":"Help clients establish realistic eating habits."},{"text":"Support physical-activity and movement goals within appropriate scope."},{"text":"Discuss sleep and recovery habits."},{"text":"Support stress-management and behaviour-change strategies."},{"text":"Track progress."},{"text":"Create wellness plans."},{"text":"Conduct workshops and awareness programs."},{"text":"Coordinate with dietitians, doctors, psychologists, fitness professionals or other specialists when required."},{"text":"Maintain client records and outcome data."}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good wellness consultant should not position themselves as a substitute for a physician, registered dietitian, clinical nutritionist or mental-health professional when a medical or clinical condition requires specialist care."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During B.Sc Nutrition & Dietetics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Nutrition & Human Biology Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals rather than immediately focusing on coaching."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human anatomy"},{"text":"Human physiology"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Fundamentals of nutrition"},{"text":"Macronutrients"},{"text":"Micronutrients"},{"text":"Food science"},{"text":"Food chemistry"},{"text":"Basic psychology"},{"text":"Introduction to public health"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Carbohydrates"},{"text":"Proteins"},{"text":"Fats"},{"text":"Vitamins"},{"text":"Minerals"},{"text":"Water and electrolytes"},{"text":"Energy balance"},{"text":"Digestion"},{"text":"Absorption"},{"text":"Metabolism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical target"},{"type":"p","text":"Be able to explain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Food","nutrient","digestion","absorption","metabolism","physiological function"]},{"type":"p","text":"without relying on generic social-media nutrition claims."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Applied Nutrition & Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical nutrition-analysis skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nutritional assessment"},{"text":"Dietary assessment"},{"text":"Food composition"},{"text":"Meal planning"},{"text":"Dietary recall methods"},{"text":"Anthropometry"},{"text":"BMI and its limitations"},{"text":"Waist circumference"},{"text":"Body-composition concepts"},{"text":"Nutritional deficiencies"},{"text":"Community nutrition"},{"text":"Food safety"},{"text":"Public-health nutrition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Nutrition databases"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic Python/R for health data"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important professional skill"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to distinguish between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence-based nutrition advice"},{"type":"p","text":"and"},{"type":"p","text":"unsupported diet trends / wellness misinformation."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Counselling & Behaviour Change"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where a nutrition graduate becomes much more effective as a wellness professional."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop skills in"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nutrition counselling"},{"text":"Behaviour-change principles"},{"text":"Motivational interviewing concepts"},{"text":"Goal setting"},{"text":"Habit formation"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Health education"},{"text":"Lifestyle coaching"},{"text":"Adherence monitoring"},{"text":"Progress tracking"},{"text":"Group wellness sessions"},{"text":"Health promotion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Healthy eating plans"},{"text":"Lifestyle improvement programs"},{"text":"Workplace wellness programs"},{"text":"Weight-management support programs within scope"},{"text":"Healthy-aging programs"},{"text":"General fitness-support nutrition education"}]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate portfolio should contain evidence of applied work, not just certificates."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — 30-Day Wellness Program"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a structured educational program covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"balanced meals"},{"text":"hydration"},{"text":"physical activity"},{"text":"sleep"},{"text":"stress management"},{"text":"habit tracking."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Measure non-clinical outcomes such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"adherence"},{"text":"participation"},{"text":"self-reported energy"},{"text":"sleep consistency"},{"text":"activity consistency."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Dietary Assessment Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct a supervised academic study involving dietary records and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"calorie intake"},{"text":"protein"},{"text":"carbohydrate"},{"text":"fat"},{"text":"fibre"},{"text":"selected micronutrients."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Present findings using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"charts"},{"text":"statistical analysis."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use appropriate ethics and consent procedures when working with people."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Corporate Wellness Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a Power BI dashboard showing anonymised program metrics such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"participation"},{"text":"workshop attendance"},{"text":"habit adherence"},{"text":"activity engagement"},{"text":"wellness-program completion."}]},{"type":"p","text":"This adds a valuable data + wellness dimension to the profile."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Nutrition Myth-Busting Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an evidence-based educational resource addressing common claims such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"detox diets"},{"text":"extreme fasting"},{"text":"supplement claims"},{"text":"“superfoods”"},{"text":"crash diets"},{"text":"carbohydrate myths."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Cite credible scientific sources and clearly distinguish evidence from opinion."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Wellness App Concept"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a prototype that tracks:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"meals"},{"text":"hydration"},{"text":"physical activity"},{"text":"sleep"},{"text":"habits"},{"text":"wellness goals."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible technology stack:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Figma","React/Flutter","Firebase/Supabase","basic analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For an AI-era portfolio, add an explainable recommendation layer rather than an unrestricted “AI doctor.”"}]},{"heading":"Three-Year Skill Development Plan","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Year 1","Year 2","Year 3"],"rows":[[{"text":"Nutrition Science"},{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Applied"}],[{"text":"Human Physiology"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Applied"}],[{"text":"Dietary Assessment"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Meal Planning"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Counselling"},{"text":"—"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Behaviour Change"},{"text":"—"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Public Health"},{"text":"Introduction"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Applied"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"—"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Research Methods"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Client Management"},{"text":"—"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"}]]}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A. Weight Management & Lifestyle Wellness"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"nutrition education"},{"text":"physical activity"},{"text":"behaviour change"},{"text":"habit formation"},{"text":"long-term adherence."}]},{"type":"note","label":"Possible roles","text":"Wellness Coach, Nutrition & Wellness Consultant, Lifestyle Coach."},{"type":"h","text":"B. Corporate Wellness"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with organisations to improve employee wellbeing."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"workplace nutrition"},{"text":"health education"},{"text":"wellness workshops"},{"text":"employee engagement"},{"text":"program design"},{"text":"wellness analytics."}]},{"type":"note","label":"Possible roles","text":"Corporate Wellness Consultant, Wellness Program Coordinator, Employee Wellness Specialist."},{"type":"h","text":"C. Sports & Fitness Nutrition"},{"type":"p","text":"Build additional knowledge in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"sports nutrition"},{"text":"hydration"},{"text":"energy requirements"},{"text":"recovery"},{"text":"performance nutrition"},{"text":"exercise physiology."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical or specialised sports-nutrition practice may require additional qualifications depending on the role."},{"type":"h","text":"D. Preventive Health"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"healthy ageing"},{"text":"lifestyle risk reduction"},{"text":"nutrition education"},{"text":"public health"},{"text":"preventive-health programs."}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is especially relevant to health-tech and preventive-care companies."},{"type":"h","text":"E. Digital Wellness"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine nutrition with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"health apps"},{"text":"wearable data"},{"text":"AI"},{"text":"behavioural analytics"},{"text":"remote coaching"},{"text":"digital health platforms."}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest future-oriented specialisations."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Practical exposure is extremely valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitals & Healthcare"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nutrition departments"},{"text":"Dietetics departments"},{"text":"Preventive-health programs"},{"text":"Community-health programs"},{"text":"Health screening centres"}]},{"type":"p","text":"If the internship involves clinical nutrition, work under appropriate professional supervision."},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Wellness"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee wellness companies"},{"text":"Corporate health platforms"},{"text":"Workplace wellness providers"},{"text":"Employee assistance/wellbeing programs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"wellness campaigns"},{"text":"nutrition workshops"},{"text":"health-awareness sessions"},{"text":"engagement tracking"},{"text":"wellness content."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fitness & Wellness"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wellness centres"},{"text":"Fitness organisations"},{"text":"Sports performance centres"},{"text":"Health clubs"},{"text":"Preventive-health clinics"},{"text":"Lifestyle-management companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Health-Tech"},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly valuable for an AI-era career."},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital health startups"},{"text":"Nutrition apps"},{"text":"Fitness platforms"},{"text":"Preventive-care companies"},{"text":"Telehealth companies"},{"text":"Health analytics companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Departments:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Nutrition","Content","Product","Customer Success","Health Coaching","Research","Data/Analytics"]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise recognised, relevant education over large collections of short certificates."},{"type":"h","text":"Core areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nutrition science"},{"text":"Dietary assessment"},{"text":"Behaviour change"},{"text":"Health promotion"},{"text":"Food safety"},{"text":"Public health"},{"text":"Exercise fundamentals"},{"text":"Health communication"},{"text":"Research methodology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Additional high-value skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Scientific literature search"},{"text":"Evidence appraisal"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Digital health"},{"text":"Wearable-data interpretation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For any certification claiming to qualify someone as a clinical dietitian, medical nutrition professional or regulated healthcare practitioner, verify the applicable Indian qualification and registration requirements before enrolling."}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Be Hired For","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct-entry roles"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on employer requirements:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wellness Consultant"},{"text":"Wellness Coach"},{"text":"Nutrition & Wellness Executive"},{"text":"Nutrition Educator"},{"text":"Wellness Program Coordinator"},{"text":"Health Coach"},{"text":"Nutrition Program Associate"},{"text":"Corporate Wellness Executive"},{"text":"Lifestyle Program Executive"},{"text":"Nutrition Content Associate"},{"text":"Health & Wellness Associate"},{"text":"Community Nutrition Program Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After 2–5 Years"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible progression toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Wellness Consultant"},{"text":"Senior Health Coach"},{"text":"Corporate Wellness Specialist"},{"text":"Wellness Program Manager"},{"text":"Nutrition Program Manager"},{"text":"Lifestyle Management Specialist"},{"text":"Preventive Health Program Specialist"},{"text":"Digital Wellness Specialist"},{"text":"Wellness Operations Manager."}]}]},{"heading":"Building a Private Consulting Career","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After developing appropriate education, experience and professional boundaries, a graduate can eventually build a consulting practice."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible services:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"General nutrition education"},{"text":"Lifestyle coaching"},{"text":"Wellness assessments"},{"text":"Habit-building programs"},{"text":"Corporate workshops"},{"text":"Wellness webinars"},{"text":"Health education content"},{"text":"Group wellness programs."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business skills required"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Client acquisition"},{"text":"Personal branding"},{"text":"Content creation"},{"text":"Consultation workflow"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Payment systems"},{"text":"Data privacy"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Service pricing"},{"text":"Customer retention"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid marketing yourself as a medical professional or claiming to treat diseases unless you possess the legally appropriate qualifications."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG is not always required for general wellness consulting, but it can substantially improve specialisation and credibility."},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Nutrition & Dietetics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"advanced nutrition"},{"text":"nutrition counselling"},{"text":"research"},{"text":"community nutrition"},{"text":"food and nutrition programs."}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Clinical Nutrition"},{"type":"p","text":"Best suited to students interested in clinical/healthcare nutrition, subject to applicable professional requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Food & Nutrition"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"nutrition research"},{"text":"public health"},{"text":"food science"},{"text":"community nutrition"},{"text":"nutrition programs."}]},{"type":"h","text":"MPH — Master of Public Health"},{"type":"p","text":"Excellent for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"population health"},{"text":"preventive health"},{"text":"health promotion"},{"text":"corporate/community wellness"},{"text":"health policy."}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Sports Nutrition / Sports Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"fitness"},{"text":"sports performance"},{"text":"athlete support"},{"text":"exercise and nutrition programs."}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Healthcare / Hospital Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for students who want to move toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"wellness-business management"},{"text":"health-tech operations"},{"text":"healthcare entrepreneurship"},{"text":"corporate wellness leadership."}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant international fields include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nutrition Science"},{"text":"Human Nutrition"},{"text":"Public Health"},{"text":"Health Promotion"},{"text":"Health & Wellness"},{"text":"Sports Nutrition"},{"text":"Behavioural Health"},{"text":"Digital Health"},{"text":"Health Informatics"},{"text":"Preventive Health."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Countries to consider"},{"type":"table","header":["Country","Relevant Areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"🇺🇸 USA"},{"text":"Nutrition, Public Health, Health Promotion, Digital Health"}],[{"text":"🇨🇦 Canada"},{"text":"Nutrition, Public Health, Health Promotion"}],[{"text":"🇬🇧 UK"},{"text":"Nutrition, Public Health, Behaviour Change"}],[{"text":"🇦🇺 Australia"},{"text":"Nutrition, Dietetics, Public Health, Sports Nutrition"}],[{"text":"🇳🇿 New Zealand"},{"text":"Nutrition, Health Promotion, Public Health"}],[{"text":"🇳🇱 Netherlands"},{"text":"Public Health, Nutrition, Health Sciences"}],[{"text":"🇩🇪 Germany"},{"text":"Public Health, Nutrition, Health Sciences"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"If the goal is to practise as a regulated dietitian/clinical nutrition professional abroad, admission to a nutrition-related master's does not automatically grant professional registration. Each country has its own education, supervised-practice and registration rules."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A realistic pathway:"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc Nutrition & Dietetics"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness/Nutrition Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition & Wellness Executive / Wellness Coach"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Wellness Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Program Manager / Corporate Wellness Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Strategy Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Wellness / Preventive Health Programs"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Independent Wellness Consultant / Entrepreneur"}]},{"heading":"Research & PhD Directions","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For students interested in research, potential areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Behavioural Nutrition"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"eating behaviour"},{"text":"habit formation"},{"text":"adherence"},{"text":"behaviour-change interventions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"obesity prevention"},{"text":"nutrition education"},{"text":"community nutrition"},{"text":"health disparities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Health"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"wearable devices"},{"text":"nutrition apps"},{"text":"digital coaching"},{"text":"AI-assisted behaviour change"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Personalised Nutrition"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"individual dietary response"},{"text":"microbiome"},{"text":"genetics"},{"text":"metabolic data"},{"text":"precision nutrition."}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Nutrition"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"dietary image recognition"},{"text":"meal analysis"},{"text":"personalised recommendations"},{"text":"nutrition-data analytics"},{"text":"conversational wellness systems."}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI should be used as a decision-support and education tool, with human oversight and appropriate safety boundaries."}]},{"heading":"2040–2046: How the Role Will Evolve","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Traditional wellness consulting:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Consultation","Diet/Lifestyle Advice","Follow-up"]},{"type":"p","text":"will increasingly become:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wearables + Nutrition Data + Behavioural Data + AI","Personalised Wellness Program","Continuous Monitoring","Human Coaching"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future wellness professionals may work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"wearable health data"},{"text":"continuous activity data"},{"text":"sleep data"},{"text":"digital nutrition records"},{"text":"AI-assisted food recognition"},{"text":"personalised nutrition systems"},{"text":"behavioural analytics"},{"text":"remote coaching"},{"text":"digital therapeutics"},{"text":"preventive-health platforms."}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future profile will therefore be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Nutrition","Behaviour Science","Digital Health","Data Analytics","Human Coaching"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human nutrition"},{"text":"Nutritional biochemistry"},{"text":"Food science"},{"text":"Dietary assessment"},{"text":"Meal planning"},{"text":"Public-health nutrition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Behaviour change"},{"text":"Health promotion"},{"text":"Lifestyle coaching"},{"text":"Goal setting"},{"text":"Habit formation"},{"text":"Client communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Health data analysis"},{"text":"Digital health platforms"},{"text":"Wearables"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Evidence appraisal"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Basic epidemiology"},{"text":"Scientific writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Counselling"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Workshop delivery"},{"text":"Client management"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Ethical practice"},{"text":"Referral and scope-of-practice awareness"}]}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, an employable B.Sc Nutrition & Dietetics student targeting Wellness Consultant should be able to say:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I can assess general nutrition and lifestyle patterns, communicate evidence-based nutrition and wellness guidance, design practical behaviour-change programs, track client and program outcomes, analyse wellness data using digital tools, conduct educational workshops, and recognise situations that require referral to an appropriately qualified healthcare professional.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Best career strategy"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Nutrition & Dietetics","Wellness/Nutrition Internship","Nutrition & Wellness Executive","Wellness Consultant","Specialise in Corporate Wellness / Preventive Health / Sports Wellness / Digital Health","Program Manager or Independent Consultant"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term differentiation is not simply becoming a “diet plan provider.” It is developing expertise across nutrition science + behaviour change + data + digital health + measurable wellness outcomes, while maintaining clear professional boundaries around clinical care."}]}]}